# Gitignored files and folders that a new worktree copies from the main
# checkout (.gitignore syntax). The t3.json setup script copies them with
# Worktrunk. Claude Code and the Codex app read this file themselves. No tool
# overwrites a file that the worktree already has.
#
# Write a folder as `plans/`, never `plans/*`: Worktrunk copies whole ignored
# folders. A `!` line inside a listed folder has no effect.
#
# Leave out a file that must differ per worktree, such as an env file that
# holds a port or points at one backend deployment.

# Agent settings and notes
.claude/settings.local.json
mise.local.toml
plans/
.scratch/

# Env files. `.env` matches the one at the root and the one in each app and
# package. If one of them must differ per worktree, list the others by path
# instead, such as `/.env` and `/apps/<app>/.env`.
.env

# Credentials that no secret manager serves, such as native service files
# /apps/<app>/google-services.json
